    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Josiah Dennis Manse Museum preserves the 1736 home of Reverend Josiah Dennis, after whom the town is named.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://citizensofcapecod.com/town-dennis/east-dennis/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Sesuit Harbor & Marina, the town’s primary marina, sits at the end of Bridge Street on Sesuit Neck.",
